# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# The cold start: TikuBasic is launched with NO project anywhere, and a
# person makes one from nothing -- through the shell's own panels,
# without touching a terminal.  A project is a FOLDER, born holding its
# description and its first source file, and the editor is already open
# on it, because a person who just made a project is there to write it.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Programming
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 25
note the application arrives announcing itself: its name, over its own
note mark, in a window that stands in front and then leaves on its own
expect-title TikuBasic
note and the banner it wears is the PERSON'S OWN: a picture put where
note the program looks -- beside the replaced icons -- is chosen, and
note the band wears it edge to edge
expect-pixel 320 180 b45a28
expect-pixel 650 180 b45a28
note and the splash screen is WIDE now: the band carries the banner past
note where the old, narrower announcement even reached
expect-pixel 740 180 b45a28
note and the announcement is PLAIN: no tab, no close button -- the
note banner starts right under the hairline at the window's own top
expect-pixel 500 140 b45a28
wait 200
expect-no-title TikuBasic
expect-title Project
note the menu offers the start; a project that does not say what it is
note FOR is offered no Build, and the file roads live under File
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu New Project…|Open Project…||Run
menu-pick New Project…
wait 40
expect-title Save
note the offered name names the FOLDER: taking it as offered makes
note untitled/, holding the description and the first source file
click 675 413
wait 120
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/project.tiku title untitled
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/project.tiku file main.bas
note and the editor is already open on main.bas, at half the screen,
note the page numbered 10 with the caret standing black just past it
expect-title main.bas
expect-pixel 216 296 000000
note the source file is REAL before anything was ever saved: the Open
note panel stands in the project's own folder and LISTS it, and picking
note it brings the open editor forward rather than opening a second one
click-window Project
wait 8
click 132 8
wait 8
expect-menu New File…|Open File…|Add File…
menu-pick Open File…
wait 40
expect-title Open
click 400 200
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-title main.bas
note typing lands after the number, and Return TYPES the next number
note itself, counted by tens the way the interpreter counts
key h shift
key i
wait 8
key Return
wait 8
key x
wait 10
note the toolbar's Save is the same gesture as the menu's, one reach
note closer to the hand
click 205 268
wait 60
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/main.bas 10 Hi
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/main.bas 20 x
note a second file, through the File menu
click-window Project
wait 8
click 132 8
wait 8
menu-pick New File…
wait 40
expect-title Save
click 675 413
wait 90
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/project.tiku file untitled.bas
expect-title untitled.bas
note back on the first editor by its Window row, the count continues
note where it stood
click-window Project
wait 8
click 185 8
wait 8
menu-pick main.bas
wait 30
expect-title main.bas
key Return
wait 8
key z
wait 10
click 205 268
wait 60
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/main.bas 30 z
note the page is the person's to resize: the corner is dragged in and
note the editor repaints at the size the window now is -- the strip
note stands at the new bottom, where the old painting had only page
press 810 672 1
wait 4
move 700 500 1
wait 4
release 700 500 1
wait 80
expect-pixel 250 486 d8d8d8
note the Window menu names every editor, and reaches them
click-window Project
wait 8
click 185 8
wait 8
expect-menu main.bas|untitled.bas
menu-pick untitled.bas
wait 30
expect-title untitled.bas
note and a folder that does not exist yet is made without leaving the
note panel: the name field names the folder, New folder steps inside,
note and the offered name comes back, ready to make a project there
click-window Project
wait 8
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick New Project…
wait 40
expect-title Save
key b
key l
key i
key n
key k
key e
key r
wait 6
click 410 413
wait 30
click 675 413
wait 120
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/blinker/untitled/project.tiku title untitled
note and the first project is untouched beside it
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/untitled/project.tiku file untitled.bas
